1.49 (of predefined SDF actors together with a means of specifying how to connect a set of) 108 439 P
4.01 (instances of these actors into an SDF graph constitutes a programming language.) 108 418 P
-0.02 (Augmenting the actor library with a means for defining new actors, perhaps in some other) 108 397 P
0.79 (programming language, defines a more general SDF-based programming language. This) 108 376 P
